   "unit": "pct",
   "period_type": "standing",
   "period_fy": null,
   "period_label": "standing band",
   "quote": "We have given double digit guidance for volume and we are already 12%-13% in 9-month basis and EBITDA margin on polymer, we have given between 16%-18% range and Adhesive and Paint, we have given between 12%-14% margin.",
   "page": 7,
   "speaker": "Sandeep Engineer",
   "stated_on": "2026-02-05",
   "source_url": "https://www.astralltd.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Investec-Astral-Feb05-2026.pdf",
   "notes": [
    "may refer to a segment, not the whole company"
   ],
   "target": "12\u201314%",
   "revisions": [
    {
     "stated_on": "2025-08-18",
     "target": "14\u201316%",
     "quote": "Margins are within our guided limits of 14% to 16% in the adhesive business.",
     "page": 2,
     "source_url": "https://www.astralltd.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Transcript-of-Earning-Call-held-on-12th-August-2025.pdf"
    },
    {
     "stated_on": "2025-08-18",
     "target": "16\u201318%",
     "quote": "So, whatever margin for the piping business, we have guided 16% to 18%.",
     "page": 15,
     "source_url": "https://www.astralltd.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Transcript-of-Earning-Call-held-on-12th-August-2025.pdf"
    },
    {
     "stated_on": "2025-08-18",
     "target": "~2%",
     "quote": "As far as the demand is there in the market and we feel that we are able to get good growth by dropping 1% or 2% margin, I think we will be happy to do that thing.",
     "page": 15,
     "source_url": "https://www.astralltd.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Transcript-of-Earning-Call-held-on-12th-August-2025.pdf"
    },
    {
     "stated_on": "2025-11-06",
     "target": "15\u201316%",
     "quote": "I am very happy to share that in this quarter also we have delivered a very healthy 20% volume growth and 15% value growth and above the guided margin range of 15% to 16% EBITDA on a consolidated basis.",
     "page": 4,
     "source_url": "https://www.astralltd.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/Transcript.pdf"
    },
    {
     "stated_on": "2025-11-06",
     "target": "15\u201316%",
     "quote": "So definitely it is going to help us in the margin improvement also, but as of today we have given the guidance of 15%-16%.",
     "page": 6,
     "source_url": "https://www.astralltd.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/Transcript.pdf"
    }
   ],
